        "Content": "Superb 4 Bedroom, 3 Bathroom, Coastal Property, 264 sq. mts. 0.5 acres"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Driving along the R600 from Kinsale to Clonakilty, via the Coast  \"Springfields \" is perched on a slightly elevated site, overlooking the bay.\r\nIt is a most beautiful and deceptive property in terms of scale, great design, and beautiful setting.\r\nSouth facing, the property is flooded with light and brightness, beautifully and tastefully appointed throughout.\r\nAccommodation includes: 2 Reception Rooms,  Kitchen/Utility, 3 Bedrooms, 2 Bathroom, 1 ensuite, Study/Office, an amount of storage space.\r\nAdditional accommodation within a self contained apartment, comprising of a Living Room, Contemporary Kitchen on the ground floor, \r\na bright and sunny Bedroom with en-suite on the first floor, an ideal layout for visitors, teenagers, a space to call your own.\r\nGenerally regarded as being  in the more tranquil and restful side of Courtmacsherry Habour, this property occupies a most unique  and beautiful setting with open uninterrupted panoramic 360 degree views taking in both land and sea.\r\nSitting in a wonderful, verdant, rolling countryside, this property is truly a beautiful home, offering the best of country, coastal lifestyle living..\r\nStep out into the garden and enjoy the West Cork countryside, a lush green oasis, now splendidly mature, packed with specimen trees and shrubery, lined by herbaceous borders, cut through by little pathways- in essence, as pretty as a storybook.\r\nThe general area emerges as a tranquil location appreciated by nature lovers and watersports enthuasists alike.\r\nIts vastness makes it appealing for those wanting space away from crowds while enjoying scenic coastlines, ideal for outdoor activities.\r\nTraditionally, the area is home to many established families who have resided there for many years, little change over time.\r\nMore recently, there has been a mix of traditional and contemporary style homes as new owners are availing of the most appealing vistas.\r\nThe villages of Timoleague and Courtmacsherry are a short drive away, Clonakilty/Kinsale 20 minutes away, Cork City/Airport, 45 minutes away.\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
